        <item>
            <title>2.20.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:05:21 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>96</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.20.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Peer names in the sidebar and pane headers.** A session you can reach over inter-session messaging now shows the name it answers to — the one `/rename` sets. It sits under the session title in the sidebar and beside it in a pane header, and follows a rename within a few seconds. Closed sessions have no running process, so they show no name.

### Changes

- **Save and Quit now restores every open session, not just the ones that had a pane.** A session that was open without a pane comes back as a sidebar row, and starts the moment you give it a pane.
- The quit confirmation no longer promises to restore only the sessions it counted.
]]></description>
